  "query_preview": "..High pressure will remain in place through this \nforecast period. The high is strong enough to keep the atmosphere \ncapped and daytime temperatures generally above normal. Limited \nmoisture attempts to move in from the east from time to time, but it \nis doubtful this will result in much more than fair-weather cumulus.\n\nThis pattern will keep daily easterly breezes going, especially on \nSunday, but nothing very consequential. That is about it, maybe some \nmoisture after the end of this forecast period, as low pressure \nattempts to develop off the west coast, but a very low-confidnce \nscenario at this time.",
